@startuml F1.9-D06-detalhe-solicitacao
title F1.9-D06 — Detalhe da solicitação
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RequestsController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: /solicitacoes/:id
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /requests/{id}
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok + dono (anti-IDOR)
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT request\n+ events DESC
Postgres --> Ctrl: dados
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 + timeline + _links
note right of WebApp
  ActionBar só via useActions
  RN-F1.9-01
end note
WebApp --> Aluno: detalhe + ações

@enduml
